        "TileImage": "$($repository 739b0044-c2c1-4487-8222-675bf8eaf9cd).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47. Intelligence confirms a criminal drug buisness meeting in Sapienza. Your Targets are Sal Falcone, the group&apos;s leader; Christiano Depretis, chief narcotics manufacturer; Luigi Germano, his assistant; Nicola Scanarotti, distributor and personal bodyguard; and Benvenuto Lucchese, salesman and public spokesman. Their drug operation ends today. Eliminate all targets. Good luck, 47.",
